../../projectDescription.svi

# Prompt
This is a registry of parsed objects of type SVIFile.
It is a singleton.

method public static getInstance(): ParsedSviDirectory
method getParsedSviFile(sviFilePath : string) : SVIFile | null

This method checks if parsed svi file is in the directory of SVI files.
If not, it is parsed with the SVIParser class which returns SVIFile type.
And the parsed file is stored to the directory.
If parsing is unsuccessful, the method returns null.

Additional requirements:
* For each file being parsed a SVIParser instance should be created and stored in 
a class attribute
* Unsuccessfully parsed files also should be stored to avoid several attempts

method logParseMessagesForFile(sviFilePath : string) : void
It calls the method SVIParser.logParseMessages for the corresponding instance of
the SVIParser class that correspond to this file.